1
00:00:12,120 --> 00:00:19,964
Au premier abord, Hugo me paraissait froid et distant. J'avais l'impression qu'il ne m'aimait pas.
At first sight, Hugo seemed cold and distant to me. I had the impression that he didn't like me.

2
00:00:20,064 --> 00:00:22,652
Et en réalité ?
And in reality?

3
00:00:22,752 --> 00:00:30,452
Il est simplement timide. Il me semble qu'il s'est senti mal à l'aise parce qu'il ne me connaissait pas.
He's simply shy. It seems to me that he felt uncomfortable because he didn't know me.

4
00:00:30,552 --> 00:00:35,204
Il semble que beaucoup de premières impressions soient fausses.
It seems that many first impressions are wrong.

5
00:00:35,304 --> 00:00:42,380
Oui, je me suis complètement trompée sur lui. Il est drôle et très généreux.
Yes, I was completely wrong about him. He's funny and very generous.

6
00:00:42,480 --> 00:00:48,740
Il vaut mieux attendre avant de juger. Un malentendu est vite arrivé.
It's better to wait before judging. A misunderstanding happens quickly.
